{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1459427-fan-matrix-storypath","id":1459427,"title":"[Fan] Matrix Storypath","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-09-09T07:15:50-07:00","id":1459427,"title":"[Fan] Matrix Storypath","content":"Here we go again, with hype train! With <a href=\"http://\u200bhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9ix7TUGVYIo\" target=\"_blank\">Matrix 4 trailer</a> my love for this franchise return to foreground. ( I'm old fanboy \ud83d\ude09 ) Decade ago I made fan addon/conversion of <b>Matrix</b> for <b>nWoD</b> / <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> 1E - and I think it was still playable. Let's return to the idea, with <b>Storypath</b> rule engine then. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Rules wise, conversion should be fairly easy. Most characters works like normal people from <b>Trinity</b> corebook. <a href=\"https://matrix.fandom.com/wiki/Redpill\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Redpills</b> </a>( rebeliants ) in Matrix and <a href=\"https://matrix.fandom.com/wiki/Agent\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Agents</b></a> would use simpler <b>Aberrant </b>Mega Attributes - and maybe few simple powers.<br /> <br /> Anything more by you to point out?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 09-09-2021, 10:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-09T07:35:52-07:00","id":1459429,"title":"","content":"I'd wait for Anima; this is very much within its wheelhouse.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-09T08:02:49-07:00","id":1459432,"title":"","content":"But without Anima, as it can take 2 years from now even? I got good feeling that for recreating most of Matrix stuff, Trinity core and Aberrant should be enough?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-09T08:47:11-07:00","id":1459438,"title":"","content":"Inside the Matrix, I would go for a Talent stuff for most of the effects. Talents can spend 1 Inspiration to gain scale in any action, including running, jumping, and fighting. They would have a limited number of times, but very flexible use. Other things they can do would be dramatic editing things, like having guns, lots of guns, or things like that.<br /> <br /> Guys like Morpheus and Trinity would be high inspiration talents, with some custom made gifts (to jump even higher than usual or fight even faster). A few examples from Fists of Flux (check my book)<br /> <br /> BULLET TIME<br /> Keywords: Momentary, Skill (Close Combat) Prerequisites: Close Combat 3 and Precise<br /> Martial Arts 3<br /> Time flows for everyone, but the character can notice and react so fast the time seams to stop. System: Spend an Inspiration to gain Scale on any physical action that rely on speed and on her defense until receive Focus again. The character can do a number of actions in a single round equal to her Cunning attribute dots plus her Intuitive Facet, gaining an enhancement equal to the number of additional actions up to the Intuitive Facet.<br /> <br /> LIGHT STEPS<br /> Keywords: Momentary, Skill (Athletics) Prerequisites: Athletics 3 and Free Running 3 People train to be able to jump higher, run faster and balance with grace, the character have an advantage over them, she can become lighter.<br /> System: Spend an Inspiration when your char- acter is about to do a Athletic feat that can take advantage of a lighter body, it allow the character to climb at regular running speed, jump up to 2 range bands, horizontally or vertically, and run at speed scale 2 for the rest of the scene. Also, as long not carrying any object or creature size 0 or larger, the character is capable of stand on surfaces and objects that would not be able to hold her weight, like thin ice, leaves and fresh snow, and can even step on water as long it don\u2019t last for more than a moment, enough to run over water and even jump from its surface, but not to stand still on it.<br /> <br /> Out of the Matrix they would be regular people, basically they use the same character seer, but don\u2019t have access to any of the gifts, facets, inspiration, etc.<br /> <br /> For the Agents (and other programs), they can be made as Novas as you suggested, some could even have powers, like the twins and their ghost form.<br /> <br /> Neo specifically would be a Technokinetic (working outside the matrix too). Tap allow to work as a Talent spending Psi instead of inspiration and using psi as Facets when needed, as well as sensing things (works like Attunement inside the matrix), Access allows to use TK + Psi to do anything and spend psi to gain enhancements when doing so, Control turn successes into nova traits for the rest of the scene (reactivate the power to change the nova traits) and Code allow to rewrite the matrixes as wish.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-09T11:46:09-07:00","id":1459456,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1459427-fan-matrix-storypath?p=1459432#post1459432\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But without Anima, as it can take 2 years from now even?</div> </div> </div> </div>Anima might not officially release for another couple of years, but Kickstarter backers will have access to the manuscript, as always.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-28T02:17:41-08:00","id":1471387,"title":"","content":"Watching <b>Matrix 4</b> - BTW great movie, you must watch it! - I wonder if <b>TC Assassins</b> <i>Masteries</i> impossible feats are much better in recreating wall jumps and block jumping - instead of <b>TC Anima</b> simplified stats for <i>TerraSurge</i>... \ud83e\udd14","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 12-28-2021, 08:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[